  "prefLabel": "He-P 4070.09 Insufficient Funds",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4070.09 Insufficient Funds. Should a check or other instrument from an applicant, licensee, or registrant be uncollectible from the paying institution, the DHHS shall:\n\n(a) Add any bank, state treasurer, or other charges resulting to the amount owed;\n\n(b) Notify the applicant, licensee, or registrant in writing to the last address known to the DHHS; and\n\n(c) Allow the person 15 days to correct the matter without penalty per He-P 4070.08(b)(1).",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p4062-4097.html"
}
